OL,3,GNEWSARow over cancellation of #6.3m
OL,4,Acouncil contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Reform UK councillor said he
OL,7,Fcancelled a multi-million pound
OL,8,Fcontract because it was "a waste of
OL,9,Fmoney", but an opposition leader
OL,10,Faccused him of "political
OL,11,Fgrandstanding".
OL,13,FNorfolk County Council previously
OL,14,Fagreed a deal with consultancy firm
OL,15,FInner Circle to help with controversial
OL,16,Fplans to reorganise local government.
OL,18,FBut the Reform deputy council leader
OL,19,FRobin Hunter-Clarke, whose party took
OL,20,Fcontrol of the authority in May, argued
OL,21,Fthe deal ` said to be worth up to #6.3m
OL,22,F- was poor value.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
