OL,3,GNEWSARow over cancellation of #6.3m
OL,4,Acouncil contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative Kay Mason Billig, the
OL,7,Fcouncil's former leader, said the
OL,8,Fcontract had been agreed because staff
OL,9,Fneeded extra support with "an
OL,10,Fexceptionally complicated
OL,11,Freorganisation".
